stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RUNNING: start timer
    RUNNING --> PAUSED: pause timer
    PAUSED --> PAUSED: pause again
    PAUSED --> RUNNING: resume timer
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: resume again
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: stop timer
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: cancel timer
    PAUSED --> CANCELLED: cancel timer
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
